	"iwsource-title": "在木工工作站制作",
	"iwsource-plank-text": "在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上用框锯将原木纵向锯开，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上锯成。合成格中的锯切配方已由这些工作站取代。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-plank-text-also": "也可在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上用框锯，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上将原木锯成，此外合成格中仍可制作。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-supportbeam-text": "在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上用框锯，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上，将去皮原木锯成。合成格中的锯切配方已由这些工作站取代。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-supportbeam-text-also": "也可在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上将去皮原木锯成，此外合成格中仍可制作。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-firewood-text": "在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上用斧头将原木劈成，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:chopper-frame-north\">自动劈柴机</a>上劈成。合成格中的木柴配方已由劈柴墩取代。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-firewood-text-also": "也可在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上用斧头将原木劈成，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:chopper-frame-north\">自动劈柴机</a>上劈成，此外合成格中仍可制作。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-stick-text": "也可在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上用斧头将木柴劈成，或徒手将浮木掰开取得。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-log-text": "在木工工作站加工：在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上用斧头劈成木柴，或在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上、或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上锯成木板。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-logsection-text": "在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上、或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上锯成木板，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上劈成木柴。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。",
	"iwsource-debarkedlog-text": "在一对<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawhorse\">锯木架</a>上、或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:sawmill-frame-north\">自动锯木机</a>上锯成支撑梁，或在<a href=\"handbook://block-immersivewoodworking:choppingblock\">劈柴墩</a>上劈成木柴。\n\n另见<a href=\"handbook://craftinginfo-woodworking\">木工</a>总览。"
}
